<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Gen Physiol</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of General Physiology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0022-1295</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-7748</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2233866</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">1196</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1085/jgp.20020507119487cor</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Correction</article-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>6</month><year>2002</year></pub-date><volume>119</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>613</fpage><lpage>613</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2002, The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="119" page="487" id="N0x1c25ac0N0x1d755d0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="11981025" ext-link-type="pubmed">Prakiya, M., and R.S. Lewis <italic>The Journal of General Physiology</italic>. Volume 119, No. 5, May 2002. 487&#x02013;508.</related-article></p><p>Page 502, Figure 12 legend, ninth line</p><p>Due to an editorial error the units of Ni<sup>2+</sup> appeared incorrectly. The corrected sentence appears below:</p><p>Spectra were collected and averaged in 0 Ca<sup>2+</sup> + 2 mM Ni<sup>2+</sup> (dotted trace, &#x0201c;bkgd&#x0201d;), and near the peak of the transient Na<sup>+</sup> CRAC current (&#x0201c;peak&#x0201d;) and after Na<sup>+</sup>-ICRAC reached steady-state (&#x0201c;s-s&#x0201d;).</p></body></article>